# Thassa's Oracle: "If X is greater than or equal to the number of cards in your library, you win the game" - at equality
# too. Its devotion to blue is 2 (UU) and two cards are left in Bot1's library after the turn-3 draw, so Bot1 wins
# (CR 104.2b); thassas-oracle-with-a-larger-library-only-arranges-it is one card more than X, and nobody wins. "Up to one"
# on top may be none: both cards go to the bottom.
[Bot1 Deck]
Thassa's Oracle
Island x6
Island
Forest
Swamp
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thassa's Oracle.Cast
Bot1.Arrange( | Swamp; Forest)
[Expect]
Result = Bot1 won
